WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.480
<v Priya Nair>Okay, I think everyone's here. Quick one today, mostly the launch date.</v>

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.300
<v Priya Nair>Tom, where are we with the checkout page?</v>

3
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:21.600
<v Tom Becker>It works on desktop. On phones the address form still jumps when the keyboard opens, and I haven't found why. I'd say two more days, maybe three if it's the payment widget.</v>

4
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Priya Nair>Is three days a problem for marketing?</v>

5
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:38.200
<v Lena Ortiz>A bit. The newsletter goes out on Thursday and it links straight to the shop. If checkout is broken on phones that's most of our readers. Can we hold the link and send it the week after?</v>

6
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Tom Becker>That would take the pressure off, yes.</v>

7
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:52.300
<v Priya Nair>Fine. Newsletter goes out without the shop link, Lena adds it to the next one. Tom, can you post an update on Wednesday either way?</v>

8
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.100
<v Tom Becker>Sure.</v>

9
00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:02.900
<v Lena Ortiz>One more thing, do we have the product photos in the new size? The old ones look blurry on the new layout.</v>

10
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Priya Nair>I'll ask the studio today. Anything else? No? Thanks, everyone.</v>
